            "review_title": "Review at The Artisan Buon Dua Le Cafe",
            "review_text": "HughMc\nCheadle, United Kingdom632 contributions\n0\nGood food in a great spot\nSep 2018 • Business\nThe cafe is located on a lane just to the northeast of the lake. I'd recommend sitting on the outside balcony on the second floor for the sights and sounds of Hanoi and luckily there are not too many cars or scooters. The food and drinks are reasonably priced and the menu includes both asian and western dishes. The staff are very friendly and the food very edible -I'd be happy to revisit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 30, 2018",
