            "review_title": "Review at The Artisan Buon Dua Le Cafe",
            "review_text": "dreamnlivefree21\nSingapore, Singapore102 contributions\n0\nOld memories\nSep 2018 • Couples\nUsed to be called The Artisan and that was how i remembered it. My first trip to Hanoi and i stayed in the old quarters... absolutely loved hanoi and came across this restaurant by chance in a quiet charming lane. Sat on the second floor while looking at the street and away from the traffic. Glad to find the restaurant after so many years and still enjoyed sitting on the second floor looking at the streets. Don’t remember the food to be extremely good. I usually drop by for snacks, sandwiches and a cup of coffee.\nRead more\nWritten September 18, 2018",
