            "review_title": "Review at The Artisan Buon Dua Le Cafe",
            "review_text": "Martin B\nMelton, Australia426 contributions\n0\nBrilliant!\nSep 2018 • Couples\nIt seems this restaurant has had a name change as I know it as the Artisan (see pic). Regardless of name...it is brilliant! In a lane just off the north end of the lake, the prices take a tumble from lakeside ones. It wouldn't have bothered me if they were the same! Staff were so friendly it always felt like I was coming \"home\"! Visited a couple of times before heading off to other parts of Vietnam... on our return 2 weeks later we were greeted with smiles and \"Welcome back!\" (They even remembered our drink preferences!). The balcony on the second floor is perfect to people watch and just relax as life goes on. The food was fresh, delicious and well presented. Do yourself a favour... find it... go there!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 13, 2018",
