            "review_title": "Review at The Artisan Buon Dua Le Cafe",
            "review_text": "Jules20056\nSunbury, Australia347 contributions\n0\nSimply Fabulous\nSep 2018 • Friends\nThe restaurant is run by Aussies although the staff are locals. We found the place by chance and enjoyed it so much we visited a few times over 3 weeks. The staff are fantastic and quickly got to know us and what we drank and we were greeted like friends. They really made us feel welcome.\n\nThe menu is varied and the food is great and very reasonably priced. The fried spring rolls are a delight. Bun cha and the seafood basket are also good. Drinks are also very reasonably priced.\n\nVery well located just a short stroll from the lake.\n\nGet a seat at the counter on the verandah upstairs and watch the comings and goings on the street.\n\nI can't recommend this place highly enough.\nRead more\nWritten September 8, 2018",
